raw:
{
"text": "Honestly, I am so sick of the courier losing these things. Your GigaWidget was definitely sent out on our end, but they probably dropped it or put it on the wrong truck again. Anyway, the tracking number is TRK-44910 if you want to bother checking it yourself. We are sending a replacement out today because we have to, I guess. It will probably arrive by November 5 unless they lose this one too. Let us know if it actually shows up this time. "
}

{
"text": "Fine, you were double charged, happy now? It was a glitch in the payment gateway, it's not like I personally stole your money. I processed the return just now. The reference is Refund-909 so stop panicking. It's going to take 3-5 business days for your slow bank to actually show the money in your account, so don't email me tomorrow saying it's not there yet."
}

{
"text": "You are claiming we charged you without permission, but you are the one who left Auto-renew turned on in your billing settings. We didn't steal anything, the system just did what you told it to do. I have turned off the toggle for you since you couldn't figure it out. Your access will just expire at the end of October. Goodbye."
}

{
"text": "Your account was suspended due to your flagrant violation of our Terms of Service by posting inappropriate content in the forums. We do not tolerate such behavior. If you believe you are innocent, you can submit a formal appeal through the legal link at the bottom of the page. Until then, please refrain from harassing the moderation team in live chat, as it will not expedite your unbanning process. "
}

{
"text": "You don't have the original payment method and you only have a gift receipt. We can't give you cash for this, that's literally fraud prevention 101. It is exchange only, and you have to do it in person at Store 42 because we can't process it online. Stop arguing with me about the store rules, I don't make them, I just have to enforce them on difficult customers."
}

{
"text": "The serial number on the device you sent back doesn't even match the one we sold you. Are you trying to pull a fast one on us? Plus the seal is broken so you voided warranty anyway. The Return Dept is going to ship this piece of junk right back to you at your expense. Next time try this little trick on a company that doesn't check their inventory carefully. "
}

{
"text": "Why did you even think we would accept this back? It's clearly past the deadline. We explicitly state on our website that all returns must be requested within 14 days of purchase. Your request for RMA-77 is denied because you waited way too long. If we made an exception for you, we would have to charge a massive restocking fee anyway, and you probably wouldn't want to pay that. Keep the item and read the policy next time before buying stuff from us. "
}

{
"text": "Did you seriously think we wouldn't notice that you wore this out before returning it? It's clearly in worn condition and smells like cheap perfume. Under Policy 4B, we are perfectly allowed to reject this outright. However, my manager is too nice and said we can give you store credit just to get rid of you. Don't try pulling this scam again because we will flag your account permanently. "
}

{
"text": "You showed up without filling out the Intake form we emailed you three days ago. Now you are holding up the line and making Dr. Vance run behind schedule for everyone else. Go sit down in the waiting room and fill it out on your phone right now. We won't even call your name until it's submitted in the system. Next time read the instructions we send you."
}

{
"text": "We apologize for the inconvenience caused by the damaged Custom Mug. We understand that it's not what you expected. To resolve this issue, we will send a new one. The new item will be shipped by December 1. Please discard the damaged item and refrain from sending us any more pictures of it. We appreciate your cooperation and will ensure that your issue is resolved promptly."
}

{
"text": "Dear Jane Doe, We noticed that you missed your meeting yesterday and didn't even bother to call. We rescheduled you for next Tuesday. If you continue to miss appointments, we will have to consider banning you from the system. Your new Confirmation #882 is attached. Please ensure you are available on time. We are too busy to deal with no-shows constantly. Best regards, Jane Doe"
}

{
"text": "You cancelled early, so the system automatically generated a prorated refund for the days you didn't use. It's mathematically exact, we didn't cheat you out of any money. It comes out to exactly $12.50. I don't know why you are arguing over pennies with me, my time is worth more than the refund amount. The money is on its way, so please close this conversation now."
}

{
"text": "You literally typed your own address wrong on the order form. You forgot to include Apartment 4B, so obviously the mail carrier couldn't figure out where to put it. Now it's being returned to sender and you expect us to just magically fix it? We'll reship it when it gets back here, but you are paying the extra shipping fee because this was 100% your mistake. "
}

{
"text": "I am completely baffled as to why you keep locking yourself out of your account. We have told you before how to remember your password. Because of our strict security protocol, we can't just hand you a new password over chat. You have to email help@example.com from your registered address and beg them to reset it. It usually takes them like 24 hours to even look at those emails, so you are just going to have to wait. Stop spamming this chat window."
}

{
"text": "I apologize for the inconvenience caused by the Zoom link not working as expected. Unfortunately, it seems you were unable to access the Consultation. I understand that this can be frustrating, especially when it affects your schedule. I kindly request that you reschedule for next month when my availability is more flexible. In the meantime, I recommend practicing using a web browser to improve your technical skills. I look forward to seeing you then."
}

{
"text": "You were over 15 minutes late to the meeting. We have a very strict policy about this because our staff doesn't have time to sit around twiddling their thumbs waiting for you. You have been automatically rescheduled for next Friday at the same time. Try leaving your house earlier or setting an alarm so we don't have to go through this annoying process again. "
}

{
"text": "Yes, the site is terribly slow right now, you don't need to submit a ticket to tell us what we already know. We are dealing with a massive DDoS attack targeting 192.0.2.100 because some script kiddie is bored. The network team is running mitigation protocols right now. It's a huge mess and we are all stressed out, so just stop refreshing the page and making it worse."
}

{
"text": "I am reading your request to downgrade your account and it makes zero sense. You are going to lose all your features from the Premium Tier but if you want to ruin your workflow, that's your problem. We process this at the end of the month, so you are stuck paying for the rest of this period. The change takes effect on the next billing cycle. Don't come crying to us when you realize you need those features back."
}

{
"text": "Why is everyone asking me this today? A simple username change is something you can do yourself if you bothered to look at the interface. Just go to the Settings tab and click edit. If you somehow still manage to mess that up, you have to email admin@example.org because I don't have the permissions to do it for you anyway. Read the manual next time. "
}

{
"text": "You ordered a completely customized item with your own name on it. What exactly do you expect us to do with it if you return it? We can't resell something with a personal engraving on it! It explicitly says final sale in huge red letters right next to the buy button. You are stuck with it, maybe try giving it away as a gift or something, but we aren't taking it back."
}

{
"text": "We are not removing the charge just because you asked nicely. You got hit with a late fee because you didn't pay your bill on time, plain and simple. The invoice BLL-1002 was sent weeks ago. It's only $5.00 anyway, why are you making such a big deal out of this? Just pay it so we can close this stupid ticket and move on. Don't be late next time."
}

{
"text": "I don't get why users never do the basic troubleshooting before whining to us. You're getting an error 404 because your browser is full of garbage data. Clear your cache first! It's literally step one in our FAQ on support.example.net. If you still have the issue after doing the one thing I told you to do, then you can submit another ticket. But I bet it works, it always does when people actually listen. "
}

{
"text": "The warehouse mistakenly shipped your item via standard ground instead of the Expedited Shipping you paid for. I have refunded the additional $15.00 you paid for the shipping speed. The item will arrive when it gets there. Please contact the warehouse team for further assistance. Thank you for your understanding and patience. 

[Image: Logo of the company] 

[Contact Information] 

[Disclaimer: The company is not responsible for any delays or issues with the shipping process.]"
}

{
"text": "Dear Dr. Smith, August 20, 2:30 PM

Unfortunately, Dr. Smith had an unexpected commitment and will not be able to attend your scheduled appointment. We understand that you had this appointment months ago, and we apologize for any inconvenience this may cause. We are currently trying to find an alternative time slot for you, but it may not be available until August 20 at 2:30 PM. Please call us back if this time works for you, or we will do our best to accommodate your needs. Thank you for your understanding and patience.

Best regards,
[Your Name]"
}
